00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:16.530
Like every time you run through the second level that those those trucks will show up at that specific spot.

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:20.230
But the rocks and the and anything that's falling.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:25.510
Look, I'm not going to say that that's good game design, but I don't think it's cheap.

00:08:25.510 --> 00:08:31.250
I think it's just a way of like reminding you of your place on this battlefield.

00:08:31.630 --> 00:08:33.670
Like, you know, you're not going to get anywhere.

00:08:33.750 --> 00:08:37.750
Just driving 100 miles an hour into into a battlefield.

00:08:38.030 --> 00:08:44.710
You know, sure. I guess if it was just the missiles, I could say, OK, they're aiming for me, obviously.

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:46.550
But if but falling rocks, I don't know.

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:48.250
You assume that they were heat seeking missiles.

00:08:48.610 --> 00:08:49.770
Yeah. Well, I don't know.

00:08:49.870 --> 00:08:50.910
Like somebody shot them.

00:08:51.190 --> 00:08:52.650
Yeah. OK, but I'm falling rock.

00:08:52.790 --> 00:08:54.450
That's just a that's just a force of nature.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.690
Here's another thing about the missiles in the game.

